.nh
.TH "PB-CONFIG-CONFLICT-LIST" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-config-conflict-list - List current path conflicts


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb config conflict list [environment] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List current path conflicts

.PP
List unresolved paths for one environment or across assigned environments. Each entry identifies the path that needs review before synchronization can continue.

.PP
Conflicts identify exact paths whose local and repository versions cannot be merged automatically. Review the affected path before choosing a side; resolution records a deliberate decision for the next synchronization step.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-config-conflict(1)\fP
